@crew v-varela-edda
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello hello. Edda. I sell kettles. Do you need a kettle? Everyone does.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Two kettles sold already. The galley said no. Rudely.   #funny
?

== chat
- My case is all samples. Spoons, mostly. And one very nice kettle.
- I call home every night. Mum asks what I sold. Today: a smile.

== near
? habit:bar-regular
- The bar's the best shop on any ship. Everyone's in a buying mood.   #funny
? place:mess
- Your galley has six kettles. I counted. They're very good kettles.
?

== bye
- {bye}. If you want a kettle, I'll be by the window.

== smalltalk
- Lovely kettle, that. Not as good as mine.   #funny
- Two sold. One to go.
